{"unit_id":"tag:09BI:proof","translation":"选取平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0001>，使<MATH_0002>常值（constant），不妨写为<MATH_0003>，其中用到某个由有限（finite）的<MATH_0004>-模（modules）组成的有限（finite）复形（complex）<MATH_0005>。见《景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》引理<REF_0001>。注意，<MATH_0006>为空（empty），如果<MATH_0007>不同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0008>，这里在<MATH_0009>中比较。对每个<MATH_0010>-模（modules）的复形（complex）<MATH_0011>，令<MATHSEG_0001>在<MATHSEG_0002>中。由于平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphisms）是开（open）的，可知<MATH_0012>是<MATH_0013>的开子集（open subset）。于是<MATH_0014>是<MATH_0015>的不交开覆盖（covering）。由于<MATH_0016>连通（connected），只有一个<MATH_0017>非空（nonempty）。由于<MATH_0018>属于<MATH_0019>，可知<MATH_0020>是<MATH_0021>-模（modules）的完美复形（perfect complex），见《代数续篇（Algebra）》引理<REF_0002>。因此可假设<MATH_0022>是有限（finite）复形（complex），由有限（finite）投射（projective）的<MATH_0023>-模（modules）组成。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"常值"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调"},{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"open subset","target_term":"开子集"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"connected","target_term":"连通"},{"source_term":"nonempty","target_term":"非空"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"perfect complex","target_term":"完美复形"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数续篇"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"fin